        {
          "id": "d9a8241a-8f1a-4fae-a153-96bf5c3398dd",
          "name": "Start an Assessment",
          "request": {
            "name": "Start an Assessment",
            "description": {},
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "assessments"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "multipart/form-data"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "request",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "type": "text",
                  "contentType": "multipart/form-data",
                  "description": "(Required) Information necessary to start the assessment.\n\nRecipient details are optional. When all of `recipientEmail`, `recipientFirstName`, and `recipientLastName`\nare omitted, the assessment is started in research mode (no vendor contact). Research-mode assessments\nmay also include any combination of uploaded `files` and/or `publicDocumentUrls`; if neither is provided,\nVISO will run public information search only.\n\nExample (vendor-contact assessment):\n{\n    \"relationshipId\": 1,\n    \"recipientEmail\": \"dan@example.com\",\n    \"recipientFirstName\": \"Dan\",\n    \"recipientLastName\": \"Example\",\n    \"publicDocumentUrls\": [\"google.com\"],\n    \"followupType\": \"MANUAL\",\n    \"followupRiskThreshold\": null,\n    \"followupTimeline\": null,\n    \"collectionTimeline\": null,\n    \"noVendorResponseAction\": null,\n    \"aiProcessingOnly\": false,\n    \"questionnaires\": [\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\"]\n}\n\nExample (research-only assessment):\n{\n    \"relationshipId\": 1\n}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "files",
                  "value": "[\"<binary>\",\"<binary>\"]",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Any files to associate with the assessment"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "id": "f2fc94d6-d504-4043-9249-89bcb02b7bfe",
              "name": "OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "url": {
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "v1",
                    "assessments"
                  ],
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "query": [],
                  "variable": []
                },
                "header": [
                  {
                    "description": {
                      "content": "Added as a part of security scheme: bearer",
                      "type": "text/plain"
                    },
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "Bearer <token>"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "method": "POST",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [
                    {
                      "description": {
                        "content": "(Required) Information necessary to start the assessment.\n\nRecipient details are optional. When all of `recipientEmail`, `recipientFirstName`, and `recipientLastName`\nare omitted, the assessment is started in research mode (no vendor contact). Research-mode assessments\nmay also include any combination of uploaded `files` and/or `publicDocumentUrls`; if neither is provided,\nVISO will run public information search only.\n\nExample (vendor-contact assessment):\n{\n    \"relationshipId\": 1,\n    \"recipientEmail\": \"dan@example.com\",\n    \"recipientFirstName\": \"Dan\",\n    \"recipientLastName\": \"Example\",\n    \"publicDocumentUrls\": [\"google.com\"],\n    \"followupType\": \"MANUAL\",\n    \"followupRiskThreshold\": null,\n    \"followupTimeline\": null,\n    \"collectionTimeline\": null,\n    \"noVendorResponseAction\": null,\n    \"aiProcessingOnly\": false,\n    \"questionnaires\": [\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\"]\n}\n\nExample (research-only assessment):\n{\n    \"relationshipId\": 1\n}",
                        "type": "text/plain"
                      },
                      "key": "request",
                      "value": "<string>",
                      "type": "text",
                      "contentType": "multipart/form-data"
                    },
                    {
                      "description": {
                        "content": "Any files to associate with the assessment",
                        "type": "text/plain"
                      },
                      "key": "files",
                      "value": "[\"<binary>\",\"<binary>\"]",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "null",
              "cookie": [],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json"
            }
